{"3691950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Elunar", "steam_appid": 3691950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Delve into hostile lands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an ever expanding selection of hand-crafted, loot-filled maps and survive against endlessly spawning hordes of enemies out to destroy your very existence. Battle against time as your foes becomes increasingly stronger as you collect loot and upgrades. Make your way to the final boss and defeat him or gain more power by clearing endless stages, the choice is yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/89fc08a0d370601cd1ffdaa96208c4e6.poster.avif?t=1782189109\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/89fc08a0d370601cd1ffdaa96208c4e6.webm?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/89fc08a0d370601cd1ffdaa96208c4e6.mp4?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combos &amp; Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different abilities to create deadly combos, or interact with environmental features to create unexpected elemental fusions. With 8 unique elements creating 22 possible elemental fusions, use your wits to outsmart and overpower your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/80c01ab5a628bf02f9b8d37dda984113.poster.avif?t=1782189109\" width=640 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/80c01ab5a628bf02f9b8d37dda984113.webm?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/80c01ab5a628bf02f9b8d37dda984113.mp4?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/68bb07962088bb0fdabf89c26b53ca2f.poster.avif?t=1782189109\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/68bb07962088bb0fdabf89c26b53ca2f.webm?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/68bb07962088bb0fdabf89c26b53ca2f.mp4?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinitely Stacking Items, Ascensions &amp; Augments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 100 unique items that you can stack to your heart's content paired with powerful character ascensions and augments, each run will never be the same. Get ready to find surprising combinations and game breaking builds that completely overpowers your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/d0eb6b81ada397e7ca14cdd314832b6f.poster.avif?t=1782189109\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/d0eb6b81ada397e7ca14cdd314832b6f.webm?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/d0eb6b81ada397e7ca14cdd314832b6f.mp4?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's stopping you from stacking a bunch of attack speed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/ea2de406a9ef338660805e6671aca013.poster.avif?t=1782189109\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/ea2de406a9ef338660805e6671aca013.webm?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/ea2de406a9ef338660805e6671aca013.mp4?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your team of 3 characters with a constantly expanding roster of characters, each with a unique set of abilities and role to match your desired playstyle! Further refine your playstyle by pairing them up with powerful artifacts that compliments their strengths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty Modifiers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, you're a seasoned veteran with elite skills? Push yourself to the limit by customizing difficulty modifiers and obtain greater rewards! Beware though, going beyond your capabilities can make the game become unforgivingly difficult...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1-4 Player Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need help or simply enjoy some company? Bring along up to 3 friends to take on this treacherous path towards the final boss!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Delve into hostile lands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an ever expanding selection of hand-crafted, loot-filled maps and survive against endlessly spawning hordes of enemies out to destroy your very existence. Battle against time as your foes becomes increasingly stronger as you collect loot and upgrades. Make your way to the final boss and defeat him or gain more power by clearing endless stages, the choice is yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/89fc08a0d370601cd1ffdaa96208c4e6.poster.avif?t=1782189109\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/89fc08a0d370601cd1ffdaa96208c4e6.webm?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/89fc08a0d370601cd1ffdaa96208c4e6.mp4?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combos &amp; Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different abilities to create deadly combos, or interact with environmental features to create unexpected elemental fusions. With 8 unique elements creating 22 possible elemental fusions, use your wits to outsmart and overpower your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/80c01ab5a628bf02f9b8d37dda984113.poster.avif?t=1782189109\" width=640 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/80c01ab5a628bf02f9b8d37dda984113.webm?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/80c01ab5a628bf02f9b8d37dda984113.mp4?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/68bb07962088bb0fdabf89c26b53ca2f.poster.avif?t=1782189109\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/68bb07962088bb0fdabf89c26b53ca2f.webm?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/68bb07962088bb0fdabf89c26b53ca2f.mp4?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinitely Stacking Items, Ascensions &amp; Augments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 100 unique items that you can stack to your heart's content paired with powerful character ascensions and augments, each run will never be the same. Get ready to find surprising combinations and game breaking builds that completely overpowers your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/d0eb6b81ada397e7ca14cdd314832b6f.poster.avif?t=1782189109\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/d0eb6b81ada397e7ca14cdd314832b6f.webm?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/d0eb6b81ada397e7ca14cdd314832b6f.mp4?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's stopping you from stacking a bunch of attack speed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/ea2de406a9ef338660805e6671aca013.poster.avif?t=1782189109\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691950/extras/ea2de406a9ef338660805e6671aca013.webm?t=1782189109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src